System Overview

The dashboard displays:

Total Logs
Total Errors
Total Warnings
Total Incidents
System Health

The system calculates:

Health Score
Error Rate
Warning Rate

Example:

Health Score: 90.12%
Error Rate: 9.88%
Warning Rate: 20.16%
Severity Assessment

The system classifies overall severity into:

🟢 LOW
🟡 MEDIUM
🟠 HIGH
🔴 CRITICAL
📈 Data Visualization

The Streamlit dashboard provides visual representations of the analyzed logs.

Log Distribution

Displays the distribution of:

Errors
Warnings
Other Logs
Incident Severity Distribution

Displays detected incidents according to:

Critical
High
Medium
Low
Interactive Visualization

Plotly is used to provide interactive charts and graphical representations of the analysis results.

🚨 Incident Detection

Detected incidents are displayed in a structured table containing:

Field	Description
Incident	Detected incident description
Priority	Incident priority
Severity	Incident severity

Example:

Incident: DATABASE CONNECTION FAILED
Priority: P1
Severity: CRITICAL
🤖 Root Cause Analysis

Each incident can be expanded to view detailed RCA information.

The RCA section contains:

Timestamp
Error message
Root cause
Possible reasons
Recommended actions

Example:

Root Cause:
Database connection failure


Possible Reasons:
- Database server unavailable
- Connection timeout
- Network failure
- Database overload


Recommended Actions:
- Verify database availability
- Check connection configuration
- Review database logs
- Monitor database performance
🧠 AI Executive Report

The AI Executive Report converts raw technical log information into a structured operational report.

The report includes:

System Overview

Provides overall system health and log statistics.

Incident Summary

Explains what happened and which components were affected.

Root Cause Analysis

Identifies probable causes and supporting evidence.

Business Impact Analysis

Evaluates the impact on:

Customer Calls
Agent Productivity
Contact Center Operations
Service Availability
Recommended Actions

Provides:

Immediate actions
Preventive actions
Monitoring improvements
Alerting improvements
Automation suggestions
Infrastructure improvements
